# Copy to .env and fill in real values. Never commit .env.
# Secrets only (credentials, keys, webhook URLs) — tunable parameters belong in
# config/*.yaml, not here. Add one line per secret as the project defines them:
#
# EXAMPLE_API_KEY=

# Issue tracker — only needed when your agent runtime has no Linear MCP server and
# must fall back to the GraphQL API (docs/agents/issue-tracker.md, rung 2).
# LINEAR_API_KEY=

# EVM JSON-RPC endpoints for AMM DEX adapters (WHI-804). Required at adapter
# startup — missing values fail fast with a clear error.
# ETH_RPC_URL=https://eth-mainnet.example
# BASE_RPC_URL=https://base-mainnet.example
# BSC_RPC_URL=https://bsc-mainnet.example

# Optional Jupiter API key for prop AMM adapters (WHI-806). Keyless works at
# 0.5 RPS; a key raises the rate budget. Header: x-api-key.
# JUPITER_API_KEY=

# Optional alert webhook for real-time engine monitoring (WHI-819 / ADR 0003).
# When unset, alerts are still evaluated on GET /health and logged to journald.
# ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL=https://hooks.example.com/services/...
